{"title":"Cooper's Reed (Cattail)","sourceTitle":"Cooper's Reed (Cattail)/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geração_Natural\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geração Natural</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Propagação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Propagação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Tipoa_de_Raizes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tipoa de Raizes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Coletando\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Coletando</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Gera.C3.A7.C3.A3o_Natural\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geração_Natural\">Geração Natural</span></h2>\n<p>Existem duas variedades de juncos que nascem no mundo: Taboa e Papiro. \"Taboa\" ou \"Papiro\" (não confundir com o item <a href=\"/index.php?title=Cattails_(Reeds)/pt-br&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cattails (Reeds)/pt-br (page does not exist)\">taboa</a>\") que são um recurso muito importante no começo do jogo. \n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Propaga.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Propagação\">Propagação</span></h3>\n<p>As taboas são propagadas transplantado raízes de taboa ou Papiro em um bloco de terreno perto de uma fonte de água. Quando plantada em plantada em <a href=\"/Soil/pt-br\" title=\"Soil/pt-br\">terra</a> ou um bloco de cascalho lamacento usando Shift+ botão direito do mouse, a raiz gerará uma planta. A planta crescerá novamente e a parte de cima da taboa crescerá ao longo do tempo. Deve-se notar que cultivar taboa não fornece novas raízes adicionais para ampliar o seu cultivo, então todas as raízes devem ser colhidas de plantas existentes.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tipoa_de_Raizes\">Tipoa de Raizes</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable align-center-2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Nome\n</th>\n<th>Planta\n</th>\n<th>Topo\n</th>\n<th>Raiz\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Taboa\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Cooper_Reed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/00/Cooper_Reed.png/100px-Cooper_Reed.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/0/00/Cooper_Reed.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_Cattail_tops.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/e3/Grid_Cattail_tops.png/100px-Grid_Cattail_tops.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e3/Grid_Cattail_tops.png/150px-Grid_Cattail_tops.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e3/Grid_Cattail_tops.png/200px-Grid_Cattail_tops.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Cattail_root.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/57/Cattail_root.png/100px-Cattail_root.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/57/Cattail_root.png/150px-Cattail_root.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/57/Cattail_root.png/200px-Cattail_root.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Papiro\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Papyrus.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/1/12/Papyrus.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Papyrustops.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/4d/Papyrustops.png/100px-Papyrustops.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4d/Papyrustops.png/150px-Papyrustops.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4d/Papyrustops.png/200px-Papyrustops.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Papyrusroot.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/Papyrusroot.png/100px-Papyrusroot.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/Papyrusroot.png/150px-Papyrusroot.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9f/Papyrusroot.png/200px-Papyrusroot.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Coletando\">Coletando</span></h2>\n<p>Os juncos tem 2 tipos. De taboa ou de papiro. Para colher os juncos, o jogador pode quebrar a planta com a mão vazia, embora isso destrua a raiz. O uso de uma <a href=\"/Knife/pt-br\" title=\"Knife/pt-br\">faca</a>, permite ao jogador colher o topo da planta e também a raiz da taboa, ou se desejar, apenas o topo da planta, preservando a raiz para coleta futura. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_Cattail_tops.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/e3/Grid_Cattail_tops.png/25px-Grid_Cattail_tops.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e3/Grid_Cattail_tops.png/38px-Grid_Cattail_tops.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e3/Grid_Cattail_tops.png/50px-Grid_Cattail_tops.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> Os tipos das plantas podem ser usados para fabricar cestas de mão ou mochilas de caçador para ampliar o inventário do jogador, assim como <a href=\"/Crafting_Recipes#Stationary_Containers/pt-br\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crafting Recipes\">recipiente</a> que podem ser usadas para colocar em algum lugar e armazenar itens. Os tipos das raízes podem ser usados para criar <a href=\"/Rope/pt-br\" title=\"Rope/pt-br\">cordas</a> que podem ser vendidas aos comerciantes ou usadas para criar arcos, para criar <a href=\"/index.php?title=Poultice/pt-br&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Poultice/pt-br (page does not exist)\">cataplasmas</a> e <a href=\"/Beekeeping/pt-br\" title=\"Beekeeping/pt-br\">colméia vazia</a>.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Cattail_root.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/57/Cattail_root.png/25px-Cattail_root.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/57/Cattail_root.png/38px-Cattail_root.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/57/Cattail_root.png/50px-Cattail_root.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> Raízes de juncos podem ser cozidas e comidas para restaurar a saciedade do jogador e são alimentos úteis no começo do jogo. Estes não podem ser usados em refeições mais elaboradas.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">{{{title}}}</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    \n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"></td>\n  </tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120001\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 101/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1842/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.808      1 Template:Navbox\n100.00%    0.808      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:17721-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120001 and revision id 45377. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Geração Natural","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"Cooper's_Reed_(Cattail)/pt-br","byteoffset":24,"anchor":"Geração_Natural","linkAnchor":"Geração_Natural"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"Propagação","number":"1.1","index":"2","fromtitle":"Cooper's_Reed_(Cattail)/pt-br","byteoffset":253,"anchor":"Propagação","linkAnchor":"Propagação"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"Tipoa de Raizes","number":"1.2","index":"3","fromtitle":"Cooper's_Reed_(Cattail)/pt-br","byteoffset":781,"anchor":"Tipoa_de_Raizes","linkAnchor":"Tipoa_de_Raizes"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Coletando","number":"2","index":"4","fromtitle":"Cooper's_Reed_(Cattail)/pt-br","byteoffset":1135,"anchor":"Coletando","linkAnchor":"Coletando"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Uso","number":"3","index":"5","fromtitle":"Cooper's_Reed_(Cattail)/pt-br","byteoffset":1480,"anchor":"Uso","linkAnchor":"Uso"}],"revid":45377,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Cooper's_Reed_(Cattail)%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T12:00:01.696Z"}